, This version of wall bed pricing is not longer used
, This file can be deleted
,Use Grid


,**
,**
,** SET COSTS FOR WALL BED CABINETRY BELOW
,** UPCHARGE FOR DIFFERENT DOOR STYLES WILL BE APPLIED AFTER
,**
Set,#CostOfMurphyBed = 1000, set default cost for murphy bed 

,** COSTS FOR TWIN WALL BED CABINETRY 
DisplaySet,#TwinRange =46,1.0  If the width of the wall bed is equal to or less than this amount it will be considered a twin size bed
DisplaySet,#MurphyBedTwin =600*#MaterialCostGroup,1.1  Cost for Twin wall Bed 

,**
,** COSTS FOR FULL WALL BED CABINETRY 
DisplaySet,#FullRange =61,2.0  If the width of the wall bed is equal to or less than this amount it will be considered a full size bed
DisplaySet,#FullHeightRange =66.5,2.0a  If the height of the wall bed is equal to or less than this amount it will be considered a full size bed
DisplaySet,#FullRangeSideFold =79,2.0b  If the width of the SideFold wall bed is equal to or less than this amount it will be considered a full size bed
DisplaySet,#MurphyBedFull =800*#MaterialCostGroup,2.1  Cost for Full wall Bed 

,**
,** COSTS FOR QUEEN WALL BED CABINETRY 
DisplaySet,#QueenRange =67,3.0  If the width of the wall bed is equal to or less than this amount it will be considered a queen size bed
DisplaySet,#QueenHeightRange =72.5,3.0a  If the height of the wall bed is equal to or less than this amount it will be considered a queen size bed
DisplaySet,#QueenRangeSideFold =84,3.0b  If the width of the SideFold wall bed is equal to or less than this amount it will be considered a queen size bed
DisplaySet,#MurphyBedQueen =800*#MaterialCostGroup,3.1  Cost for Queen wall Bed 
,**
,** COSTS FOR KING WALL BED CABINETRY 
DisplaySet,#KingRange =83,4.0  If the width of the wall bed is equal to or less than this amount it will be considered a king size bed
DisplaySet,#MurphyBedKing =1300*#MaterialCostGroup,4.1  Cost for King wall Bed

,**

,,** MISCELLANEOUS WALL BED CABINETRY QUESTIONS
,DisplaySet, #MurphyBedShelfDepth=10,         3.1      Depth of adjustable shelves and middle par for zoom room 
,DisplaySet, #MurphyBedBackHeight=(DH1+TR+MR),         3.2      Height of back in zoom room unit 




Set,(w<=#TwinRange):#CostOfMurphyBed = #MurphyBedTwin 
Set, (w>#TwinRange)&(w<=#FullRange):#CostOfMurphyBed = #MurphyBedFull 
Set, (w>#FullRange)&(w<=#FullRangeSideFold)&(h<=#FullHeightRange):#CostOfMurphyBed = #MurphyBedFull 
Set, (w>#FullRange)&(w<=#QueenRange)&(h>#FullHeightRange):#CostOfMurphyBed = #MurphyBedQueen 
Set, (w>#FullRange)&(w<=#QueenRangeSideFold)&(h<=#QueenHeightRange):#CostOfMurphyBed = #MurphyBedQueen 
Set, (w>#QueenRange)&(w<=#KingRange)&(h>#QueenHeightRange):#CostOfMurphyBed = #MurphyBedKing 

,**
,**
,**


